			{{"Yes, hello? You are... Americans? English? This is... I am Mikhail! How did you... I... No, we need your help. We need you to take down the airship, the largest one overhead. Our forces cannot get close. See if you can lure it into range.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_MKH_RADIO_CONVERSATION_REPLY"}, 0xE4919933BF49909Aull},
