			{{"Survived when no one else could.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_1_5_CRYPTIC_DESC"}, 0x7C7DD60FEEDA8438ull},
			{{"Wreathed in death.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_1_5_FLAVOR"}, 0x2C81CD3D81B1040Cull},
			{{"You bit the hand that feeds.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_2_1_CRYPTIC_DESC"}, 0xF052CD2BDA6F50FBull},
			{{"Dark wings, dark path.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_2_1_FLAVOR"}, 0xC413605B70C67560ull},
			{{"Toured the depths with great speed.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_2_2_CRYPTIC_DESC"}, 0x641BB5CFAEFE7B49ull},
			{{"Leaps and bounds.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_2_2_FLAVOR"}, 0x74CFADB9BD86D3D6ull},
			{{"Darkest sky.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_2_3_FLAVOR"}, 0xC3EB103B8A356E76ull},
			{{"To know your enemy is to find truth.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_2_4_CRYPTIC_DESC"}, 0xACDCF5AF9A67CC4Bull},
			{{"Like sightless eyes.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_2_4_FLAVOR"}, 0xE30A12C45C53236Cull},
			{{"Equipped to kill a god.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_2_5_CRYPTIC_DESC"}, 0xB32C7C2FDCA011CEull},
			{{"Bureau's pride.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_2_5_FLAVOR"}, 0x3036DFBFCD799AEBull},
			{{"The Blood does not flow.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_3_1_CRYPTIC_DESC"}, 0x7544AD13667767D4ull},
			{{"Left forgotten.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_3_1_FLAVOR"}, 0x51DA82C58AA4A17Aull},
			{{"Blood rains from the heavens, pools at your feet.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_3_2_CRYPTIC_DESC"}, 0x0E22C263D8222502ull},
			{{"Guarded sacrifice.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_3_2_FLAVOR"}, 0x69A6B16CAA4C79BEull},
			{{"Precision over force.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_3_3_CRYPTIC_DESC"}, 0xE5DA10159AF0272Cull},
			{{"Needless effort.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_3_3_FLAVOR"}, 0xE6B1EDC293B5192Eull},
			{{"Nothing can shake you.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_3_4_CRYPTIC_DESC"}, 0xE3E2C8621DD8F1E9ull},
			{{"Relentless.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_3_4_FLAVOR"}, 0xE41F5FFD060B680Cull},
			{{"Descend into the darkness and rise again, greater.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_3_5_CRYPTIC_DESC"}, 0x0C5D524BF0C8BDC2ull},
			{{"Light in darkness.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_3_5_FLAVOR"}, 0xB24BB2C72C658DC5ull},
			{{"Rescued an ally, began your journey.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_4_1_CRYPTIC_DESC"}, 0xD57A58DA3C06D313ull},
			{{"Search and rescue.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_4_1_FLAVOR"}, 0x7B0B7E2BB1458D25ull},
			{{"Secured the artifact, escaped the island.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_4_2_CRYPTIC_DESC"}, 0xA369D81AEF3B1484ull},
			{{"Obtained the blade, protected the city.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_4_3_CRYPTIC_DESC"}, 0x580F671A26FA9524ull},
			{{"Mechanized abomination.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_4_3_FLAVOR"}, 0xFB8521F70DD855CCull},
			{{"Assembled the Sword of Barbarossa.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_4_4_CRYPTIC_DESC"}, 0x386535C313BD0C5Eull},
			{{"The road ahead.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_4_4_FLAVOR"}, 0x43F65A8B34F93223ull},
			{{"All ends are new beginnings.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_CHALLENGE_4_5_CRYPTIC_DESC"}, 0x1A0D724148FBD1DEull},
			{{"I'm beginning to doubt that R is the right person to be commanding the Bureau. He keeps pushing for the focus on this goddamn sword when we need every effort on the front lines. It's madness. This is the last chance we have\342\200\224not just as an Alliance, but as living beings. The Nazis still claim to be driving this, but our reports from Germany show destruction and death on par with the rest of Europe. The dead are rising against the living, no matter what uniform we wear.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_TEXT_LOG_01"}, 0x019D83814A8013D3ull},
			{{"Bad news from the East. A surge into China from the Japanese Navy\342\200\224they've been quiet after the destruction the Yanks have caused. Apparently, Straub's twisted science has been shared across the Axis. I'm hearing reports of Kyonshi soldiers marching out of the sea. Shades of Heligoland, that.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_TEXT_LOG_02"}, 0x563D0D6E3CC131A8ull},
			{{"R has ordered Captain Nguyen to move her ships away from the U-boat patrols in the Atlantic\342\200\224all to patrol the Weddell Sea in search of one lost airplane. While we mourn the loss of Col. Jefferson and his team, this will open up the entire Eastern Seaboard of the Americas to Nazi attack. What good will a rusty sword do once the Nazis have landed their ghouls on U.S. soil?", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_TEXT_LOG_03"}, 0xFA8009375E9E9AB2ull},
			{{"We got a scrambled message from Captain Saburov\342\200\224hard to decipher, but apparently he has survived the crash. Western end of the Ronne Ice Shelf. No word from Jefferson and the crew, but Mikhail has the sword and sounds optimistic. After coming to, he scouted out the wreckage and came across four pairs of footprints moving deeper inland. Rideau wants me to lead the rescue party. We ship out in 30.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_TEXT_LOG_04"}, 0xC7AB9269BD9DEDFCull},
			{{"I don't like to go against orders, but... I have to do this. R has lost his mind, risking everything for an antique letter opener. I have to follow my heart. This just feels wrong. It feels... it's almost like I can hear a voice. Voices. Telling me. The sound of my conscience. The sword doesn't belong out there on the battlefield. The sword belongs here. It needs to stay here.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_TEXT_LOG_06"}, 0xDAD66F9B33B6A57Full},
			{{"It's becoming clearer to me now. Must be the cold sea air? The dead coming to life, all of this\342\200\224we've just misunderstood tools that have been forgotten. This is not magic. Not an act of God\342\200\224or the devil. Simply tools used by an ancient culture. Long forgotten, but just as practical as a hammer and nail. Or a sword.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_TEXT_LOG_07"}, 0x06466BDBCF23AC9Bull},
			{{"I'm laughing at how clear it seems, now that I am here. So clear. It's not so much the sword as it is the material it was forged from. Marie calls it \"magnetic monopolarized ore\"\342\200\224an extremely rare material, with the only trace particles ever uncovered in our Antarctic expeditions. We suspect the source was prehistoric meteor showers\342\200\224apparently, they were not uncommon for us. For them. For those who lived in the Antarctic. The fiery rain used to fall there all the time, showers of light against the night sky. When things were green and white blossoms grew. Before the ice covered us.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_TEXT_LOG_08"}, 0x594F86944BEBEDE6ull},
			{{"Straub was just a tool. A puppet. As was the bearded king. Barbarossa. This goes back long before he stumbled across the sword, after his ship was swept up on these icy shores. He stole our sword and used it to conquer the North... and would have taken the world if not for the ravens.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_TEXT_LOG_11"}, 0x902670CCF67F7750ull},
			{{"The damn ravens, those sent by the Rook to balance life and death. The Rook will summon them, the Rook with eyes of blood. First the Rook, then the ravens. This is how things turn. But not now. I will end the cycle.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_TEXT_LOG_12"}, 0x7F756F0A55957EEBull},
			{{"I can hear them, the ravens. Their shuffling footsteps and dirty feathers sullying hallways where gods once strode. Before internecine war and an age of ice conspired to entomb them, the gods ruled here, tall and ivory and proud. I can hear the Rook as well, this one who has travelled so far to summon the ravens. All I have are my notebook and the sword and my dreams of white flowers. I can no longer feel my fingers, but there is no cold. Just emptiness. I... I don't know how long I have been standing here. He sits wreathed in death. In Majesty.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_TEXT_LOG_13"}, 0x72958E7D0B2F27CFull},
			{{"Death shall reign. I come to you, my God-King. Bring me to the shadowed valley. I bring your sword. I bring undeath. I come to you.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_DLC4_TEXT_LOG_14"}, 0x192BB907E238FFE4ull},
			{{"No slacking off\342\200\224on your feet.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_ZOMBIE_CHALLENGE_11_FLAVOR"}, 0x54D032821CE54A3Bull},
			{{"Survive Wave 30 with only weapons from two Mystery Box uses per player in The Final Reich. Starting weapons are allowed but cannot be upgraded.", "ZOMBIES_MENU_ZOMBIE_CHALLENGE_15_DESC"}, 0x5BF962AD01A816BFull},
			{{"\"We must hurry\342\200\224he may not have much time!\"", "ZOMBIES_MENU_ZOMBIE_CHALLENGE_23_FLAVOR"}, 0xCAE4BB8CAE96DF3Eull},
