			{{"Give yourself and nearby allies 2 lethals when activating ^3Freefire^7.", "ZOMBIES_PERK_DESC_EXPLOSIVES_HANDLER"}, 0x368B77A9B2967823ull},
			{{"Increased chance to spawn power-ups when killing enemies.", "ZOMBIES_PERK_DESC_RESOURCEFUL"}, 0xBAC735B57363127Cull},
			{{"^3Shellshock^7 creates a zone of energy that lingers after the burst. Enemies that enter the zone are stunned. However, the range of ^3Shellshock^7 is reduced.", "ZOMBIES_PERK_DESC_SUSTAIN_ZONE"}, 0x6B306F321950E50Aull},
			{{"Hold ^3[{+activate}]^7 to use a Self-Revive (&&1 left)", "ZOMBIES_SELF_REVIVE"}, 0x06798CA9F099806Eull},
			{{"Locked\342\200\224research more Mods", "ZOMBIES_UNLOCK_MORE_MODS"}, 0xAC979E6F409072CCull},
			{{"Straub's broken Blitz machines can be used to electrify the area.", "ZOMBIE_BERLIN_HINT_CAGE_BLITZ_TRAP"}, 0x81E5E3F95ADC9372ull},
			{{"Sodium and chlorine ions are fantastic\342\200\224and deadly\342\200\224electrical conductors. Don't get caught off guard when the boat shifts.", "ZOMBIE_DLC3_HINT_TRAP_DNK"}, 0x434142B885DB0E79ull},
			{{"Richter's proudest accomplishment\342\200\224turning Geistkraft into a molecular assembly device. Reach into the void and see what you get.", "ZOMBIE_DLC3_HINT_WALLBUY"}, 0x34DEC64AD14EDAF7ull},
			{{"The latest in German manufacturing, these hardened-steel saw blades tipped with tungsten carbide are the tools preferred by Straub to modify his soldiers.", "ZOMBIE_ISLAND_HINT_BLADE"}, 0x8219C44FF1BB4B0Bull},
			{{"Rotating propellers create a barrier between you and the undead.", "ZOMBIE_ISLAND_HINT_PROP_TRAP"}, 0x9E58A1125D2DA439ull},
			{{"This spike mechanism can be used to impale the approaching zombie horde.", "ZOMBIE_ISLAND_HINT_SPIKE_TRAP"}, 0xB6ADBC417543811Cull},
			{{"Jefferson made sure to bring the team's Tesla weapons to the island... just in case. During the beach assault, the crate fell overboard from the Ranger vessel and the weapons were ruined. The gunstocks, however, might be salvageable.", "ZOMBIE_ISLAND_HINT_STOCK"}, 0x9C11FDE8ECC92B35ull},
			{{"Saw", "ZOMBIE_ISLAND_NAME_BLADE"}, 0x3BD28473DC941AFEull},
			{{"Handle", "ZOMBIE_ISLAND_NAME_STOCK"}, 0x935B890824C4E37Bull},
			{{"Dealing with unpredictable new energy particles added a heightened degree of lethality to the experiments in Richter's weapons lab. After overhearing the Gruppenf\303\274hrer's complaints about this inefficiency, Klaus Fischer volunteered the schematic for an automated weapons assembly table. The compact design delighted Richter, and he brought the physicist over from the morgue to work in his department, widening the growing rift between Richter and Doktor Straub.", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_ASSEMBLY_STATION"}, 0x45CB0D28DF49CFA8ull},
			{{"Designed by Gruppenf\303\274hrer Richter as a last-resort response to the second breakout by the undead experiments. This was supposed to contain\342\200\224and annihilate\342\200\224even the largest subjects.", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_BETTY_TRAP"}, 0x5060270B4E18A8E1ull},
			{{"The Mittelburg sewers quickly became clogged with the bloody remains of Doktor Straub's work. Gruppenf\303\274hrer Richter came up with an efficient solution to break up the rotting blockage.", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_CATA_TRAP"}, 0xAB6BC620A35DF130ull},
			{{"Believed to be the hilt of a sword belonging to Frederick I, the infamous German duke who rose to become king and then Holy Roman Emperor in only a few short years. The hilt appears to have been immovable for more than 700 years\342\200\224suspended in a field that has defied all modern attempts at manipulation.", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_HILT"}, 0x7E701991C503C19Cull},
			{{"The Left Hand of God, a medieval altar with four copper sheaths and a surprisingly sophisticated amplifier embedded in the base. More than just a site of worship, the altar appears to have been used to channel Geistkraft energy into the center of the chamber\342\200\224and Doktor Straub theorizes that it was used to modify the field surrounding the hilt at the center. The Nazis have just adapted the altar to integrate their \303\234berschnalle capacitors, but have not begun testing yet.", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_LEFT_HAND"}, 0x23DF02B77977F62Full},
			{{"Doktor Straub's more ambitious experiments have required a combination of both Geistkraft and electrical energy. These needles deliver short, powerful blasts that have proven to completely counter the Geistkraft current in smaller subjects.", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_MED_TRAP"}, 0x069361E8E06F8F86ull},
			{{"Paul C\303\251zanne", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_PAINTING_3"}, 0xD2AB2EF72D5CCC10ull},
			{{"The Right Hand of God, a medieval altar with a copper mechanism at its core. Centuries ago, it was connected to an array of lightning rods to draw immense power down into the chamber. The Nazis have rerouted the connection through their own branching electrical system, and have been successfully testing a retractable lightning rod prototype on the town bridge. They hope to uncover the purpose of this altar before the stormy season ends.", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_RIGHT_HAND"}, 0x6D171B9623960387ull},
			{{"Once a corpse has been surgically restored to mechanically functional status, Doktor Straub will run it through the Geistkraft induction tunnel to begin the reanimation process. This is one of the most dangerous steps in the procedure, and, if the machine isn't recalibrated after every session, it can be quite destructive.", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_RND_TRAP"}, 0x40FEA81FACD8F96Full},
			{{"After the third breakout, Gruppenf\303\274hrer Richter tried to weaponize the Geistkraft energy as a means of controlling the undead. This prototype projects a stream of Geistkraft energy particles which have been attuned through the atomic lens of crystallized undead plasma and then bonded with the alternating frequencies of two resonant transformer circuits. The weapon is destructive to any undead targets near the point of impact... and after several promising experiments, only resulted in 12 fatalities among the non-undead.", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_TESLA"}, 0x076A6CFA80D264EFull},
			{{"Klaus Fischer was fascinated by the surprising variety of ways in which Geistkraft energy could be manipulated through different resonant frequencies. He created four variants of Richter's Tesla Gun, each named after the mythical weapons wielded by Emperor Barbarossa's Royal Guards. Bloodthirst was a legendary sword said to boil the very blood of the unworthy, but it had originally been one half of a paired set of blades. The second was lost during the Crusades, but Klaus was convinced it had been returned to Germany.", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_TESLA_BLOOD"}, 0x0082A9C417F09077ull},
			{{"Klaus Fischer was fascinated by the surprising variety of ways in which Geistkraft energy could be manipulated through different resonant frequencies. He created four variants of Richter's Tesla Gun, each named after the mythical weapons wielded by Emperor Barbarossa's Royal Guards. Reaper was a legendary scythe that was said to cut through enemies as though wielded by Death himself.", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_TESLA_DEATH"}, 0xDD8FB4C874B867FCull},
			{{"Klaus Fischer was fascinated by the surprising variety of ways in which Geistkraft energy could be manipulated through different resonant frequencies. He created four variants of Richter's Tesla Gun, each named after the mythical weapons wielded by Emperor Barbarossa's Royal Guards. Midnight was a legendary morning star said to smash through the ranks of oncoming foes like moonlight through shadow.", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_TESLA_MOON"}, 0xBCCF94AB3CB93E6Aull},
			{{"Klaus Fischer was fascinated by the surprising variety of ways in which Geistkraft energy could be manipulated through different resonant frequencies. He created four variants of Richter's Tesla Gun, each named after the mythical weapons wielded by Emperor Barbarossa's Royal Guards. Hurricane was a legendary warhammer said to summon the force of a mighty storm when evil approached.", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_TESLA_STORM"}, 0x3C793534124D8C06ull},
			{{"The newfound art of reanimating dead tissue is a messy one, with a significant volume of necrotic sloughing expected from every new batch of soldiers. Doktor Straub has installed disposal tubes throughout the facility to ensure that his work space is hygienic and... safe.", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_TUBE"}, 0xDF508316C64AD20Dull},
			{{"The Voice of God, a medieval altar integrated with elements seemingly adapted from a blockwerk pipe organ. Doktor Straub considers this the most puzzling of the three altars, as strange markings found around the base of the altar seem to coincide with branded symbols discovered behind the frames of renowned\342\200\224relatively modern\342\200\224paintings scattered throughout the museums of Europe. He has had the SS steal these paintings and bring them here, but has yet to uncover how they are all related.", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_VOICE"}, 0x10C15387DDC2B69Aull},
			{{"\"Pure dead brilliant. A gas line running through a dank medieval sewer system? That's hot mince and tatties waitin' to happen, mate.\" \342\200\224Drostan Hynd", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_WELL_TRAP"}, 0x4E0E527A3187CB0Bull},
			{{"A vacuum-sealed core of crystallized plasma derived from reanimated flesh, this is both a Geistkraft battery and dampening rod with a frequency set to maximum disruption of undead neurons.", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_WW_CORE"}, 0x42FF7412882496F8ull},
			{{"Forged of austenitic steel, this barrel is built to direct Geistkraft energy towards the resonant transformer circuits at the tip.", "ZOMBIE_NEST_HINT_WW_FRAME"}, 0x9D195C129E76EAD2ull},
